<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>APOLLON | Profil</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;background:#080710;color:white;font-family:Arial;padding:25px}.top{max-width:850px;margin:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.top h1{color:#bd8aff;letter-spacing:3px}.panel{max-width:850px;margin:60px auto;background:#121020;border:1px solid #6541a5;border-radius:18px;padding:30px}.tag{color:#bd8aff;letter-spacing:2px}.info{background:#090812;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:15px;color:#ddd}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#7135bd;color:white;padding:12px 18px;border:0;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}.muted{color:#aaa}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top">
<h1>APOLLON</h1>
<form method="POST" action="/logout"><button class="btn">Çıkış yap</button></form>
</div>
<div class="panel">
<div class="tag">NEXUS MEMBER PROFILE</div>
<h2>Hoş geldin, <%= user.username %>!</h2>
<p class="muted">APOLLON üye paneline başarıyla giriş yaptın.</p>
<div class="info">Üye numarası: #<%= user.id %></div>
<div class="info">Kullanıcı adı: <%= user.username %></div>
<div class="info">Kayıt tarihi: <%= user.created_at %></div>
<br><a class="btn" href="/">Ana sayfa</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
